## Usage

### NixOS Setup

```bash
# 1. Add seforim.nix to your config
cd /etc/nixos  # or your flake directory
# Copy seforim.nix there

# 2. Import in configuration.nix
#    imports = [ ./seforim.nix ];

# 3. Rebuild
sudo nixos-rebuild switch

# 4. Build initial indexes
sudo updatedb                    # plocate (instant)
recollindex                      # recoll (few minutes first time)
```

### Emacs Setup

```bash
# Copy seforim.org to emacs directory
cp seforim.org ~/.emacs.d/

# Add to init.el:
echo '(org-babel-load-file "~/.emacs.d/seforim.org")' >> ~/.emacs.d/init.el
```

### Keybindings

| Key | Action | Index |
|-----|--------|-------|
| `C-c S f` | Find by filename | plocate |
| `C-c S F` | Find fuzzy | fd |
| `C-c S s` | Search all | recoll |
| `C-c S r` | Search all | ripgrep |
| `C-c S c` | Search current dir | recoll |
| `C-c S S` | Search choose dir | recoll |
| `C-c S o` | Outline | — |
| `C-c S t` | Toggle sidebar | — |
| `C-c S b` | Browse root | — |
| `C-c S I` | Reindex | — |
| `C-c S ?` | Status | — |

